ryday life, and they contribute in various aspects of society. \"Shinki\" are 15-centimeter-tall (about 6-inch-tall) cute partners made to assist humans. Equipped with intelligence and emotions, they devote themselves to serving their \"Masters.\"\n\nThese Shinki can even be equipped with weapons and armor to fight each other. Such Shinki are named \"Busou Shinki\" (literally, \"armed divine princesses\"). In particular, the Shinki Ann (Arnval), Aines (Altines), and Lene (Altlene) serve a high school freshman named Masato. Things change when a new Shinki, the bellicose Strarf, joins them.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Food","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Virtual World","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dullahan","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Motorcycles","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mahjong","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Busou Shinki: Armored War Goddess","english":"Busou Shinki: Armored War Goddess","native":"武装神姫","romaji":"Busou Shinki","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"武装神姬"}]},"trailer":{"id":"mO3ctjFgoIs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mO3ctjFgoIs/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}